{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもと違う髪型をしたかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとびっくりさせてみたかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって...だって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるの誕生日だからね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そっ！！！そんな訳であみ普段握手会とかで髪型で遊んだ事ないから、ちょっと今回やってみよーゆうことで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/17/1290449/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日ハッピーガールのちはるさんと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ的にはかなり冒険した方。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもねぇ思ったよあみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもと違う髪型で握手会やった方がなんかテンションが上がる。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは握手会の時もっと髪の毛で自由に遊んでみよう思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型の話は置いといて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都個別握手会❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たーーくさんの方来てくれて\n楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/17/1290449/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみのことが大好きだよ～って伝えてくれる皆様がたくさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モテ子モテ子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気分はもうねこんな感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/17/1290449/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"羽書こうとしたらうまく書けないでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと悲しい事が...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しく新規の方が増えたと同時に..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ族の中で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからあんまり来れなくなるって言う方がなぜか多い！！！！！  (´༎ຶ۝༎ຶ)  (´༎ຶ۝༎ຶ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これかなり悲しい。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあいろいろな事情があるし仕方のないことってのはわかってるだけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかそういう方が多いの！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/17/1290449/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/17/1290449/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/17/1290449/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぅ...寂しいけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょうがない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここはグッと我慢してまたあみのとこ遊びに来てくれるの待ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただなるべく早めに戻ってきてね？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こう見えて、性格はウサギちゃんなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウサギちゃんといえば、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いま家でウサギを飼いたいなーという話が出てるのよ❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのー耳がたれた小さいうさちゃん❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいよね❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いよね❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むぎゅーってしたくなるよね❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー動物とたわむれたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/17/1290449/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんのゆったんさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22日の幕張ライブが刻一刻と近づいてきてますね～っ(⊙◞౪◟⊙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当ワクワクするんですよね。本当。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ族も平日にもかかわらず来れる方が多いこれ嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち曲全曲やるなんてなっかなかないからねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは見ものですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/02/17/1290449/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うはうは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條ぶってるね～。"}],"source":"archive"}